    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42891" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scărīfo</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-īpho</span></b> ; later collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scă-rīfĭco</span></b> ,
			<i><span class="en">Pall. 4, 10, 28</span></i>; cf. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>pass.</i> scarifio,
				<i><span class="en">Scrib.
				262</span></i> dub.), āvi, ātum,
			1, v. a., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκᾰρῖφάομαι,</span>
			<i>to scratch open</i>, <i>scarify</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gingivas,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					32, 7, 26, § 79</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">truncum arboris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. Mart. 10, 28</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sinapi compressum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					12, 57, 1</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">dentes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					28, 11, 49, § 179</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">id. 30, 3, 8, § 21</span></i>.</div>
